    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Haunting revenants inhabit ruins and desolate places tied to their deaths, such as abandoned buildings, shipwrecks, or piles of junk. They hide in plain sight until their enemies come near, then trap them inside their enormous bodies, where victims may be battered by animated furniture or by stranger signs of the revenant’s hatred. The places where they lurk quickly earn a dark reputation.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
